Panel Schedule: DCP-1, 125 V DC
Fenmoor Electric LLC · Alleron Electrical Contractor Lic. #EC-12093
Drawing E-008 Rev B, 04/04/2025. System: 125 V dc, ungrounded. Location: switchgear room, beside charger BC-1. Ground detection: in charger BC-1, alarm to the switchgear annunciator.
Main: 2-pole 60 A, 250 V dc molded-case switch, lockable, fed from the battery disconnect (2 x 1/C 6 AWG Cu, 6 m) and charger BC-1. Branch breakers: 10 kA interrupting at 250 V dc. Working space: 1.0 m clear in front of DCP-1 and BC-1.
Prepared: M. Iversen, Electrical Engineer, Fenmoor Electric LLC, 04/04/2025.
